      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who hold antisemitic beliefs or are sympathetic to hate speech, as it references a group advocating 'all jews should be burned alive'. It also targets Muslim women by using their image to imply complicity in antisemitic hate, thereby appealing to or provoking those who harbor Islamophobic stereotypes. The meme's intent is to spread misinformation about Facebook's content moderation policies, which may appeal to audiences skeptical of social media platforms' handling of hate speech, particularly antisemitism. The calm, professional demeanor of the woman in the image is used to contrast with the hateful text, potentially shocking or misleading viewers into believing that such hate speech is being ignored or normalized by platforms, thus targeting those who are either unaware of or unconcerned about the consequences of antisemitic content.",
